<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Detect Curse</h1>
<p>Sphere: Detection Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Necromancer (guild level 1), Healer (guild level 11)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast detect curse &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast detect curse</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>For a while after this spell, the target sees curses: when they look at 
a cursed thing, or at someone under a curse, it shows an (orange) aura. 
A cursed thing can't be taken off once worn; see <a cmd='#'>Help Remove Curse</a>.
</p><p>The better your detection sphere, the longer it lasts. You must be 
standing, not fighting. It is also found on scrolls and potions.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Curse</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Remove Curse</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detect Magic</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>